Key Responsibilities

Executive & Client Support

Serve as a trusted partner to senior leaders, supporting daily operations, communication, and strategic initiatives.
Act as a professional liaison with clients, executives, and internal teams.
Manage sensitive and confidential information with professionalism and discretion.
Anticipate needs, take control of situations when required, and confidently make decisions to keep priorities on track.
Proactively ask questions and seek clarity to ensure accuracy and alignment on deliverables.

Communication & Presentation

Create executive-level presentations and reports using Microsoft PowerPoint and Excel, showcasing data and insights in a clear, high-impact format.
Confidently present and support communication efforts for leadership, both internally and externally.
