Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with confidence engaging high-ranking executives and clients.
Self-motivated, proactive, and comfortable working with limited direction.
Experience navigating Oracle or other ERP systems preferred (training provided).
Calm, confident, and professional demeanor with sharp attention to detail.

Why Join Us

Competitive salary and benefits
Opportunities for career growth within a global company
A collaborative, professional environment where your expertise makes a real impact

