The Role:

As an Account Executive, Institutions at Canoe Intelligence, you will develop and execute strategies to identify, engage, and close new business opportunities within our Institutional Segment. The position's primary goal will be to drive revenue growth by establishing strong relationships with key decision-makers and influencers within target institutions.

