This position provides administrative assistance to the Vice President of Academic Affairs and assists in the coordination of the Faculty Quality Assurance System (FQAS). This position also serves as liaison to staff on the Vice President's behalf. Responsible for developing, implementing, and evaluating processes and procedures within the Academic Affairs division. The individual in this position must handle and process sensitive and confidential information.

