Assist instructional supervisors in review and completion of the minimum qualifications’ materials for instructional positions. Reviewing position credentials and documents such as transcripts to ensure all items are properly documented. Collect necessary approvals as needed.
Assist instructional supervisors in managing and tracking Professional Development Plans as needed for instructors to reach minimum qualifications.
Ensure all credential documents for instructional positions are provided to Human Resources for placement within Personnel Files.
