Provide guidance to faculty and administrators on maintaining personnel documentation required for HLC, FQAS, and program accreditation requirements.
Assist in producing FQAS reports as required by WTCS.
In collaboration with Instructional Design Specialist, assist with FQAS training sessions for instructors and supervisors. Presenting at training and in-service sessions, as necessary.
