Strong customer service skills through in-person, phone, and other communication methods with the ability to communicate facts, explain procedures and answer questions from instructional supervisors, staff, and students.
Strong verbal communication skills with ability to present information to internal audiences.
Strong computer skills including MS Office Suite and Adobe Acrobat Pro.
Ability to comprehend, interpret, and instruct staff in BTC’s implementation of FQAS (re. WI Admin. Code Chapter TCS 3).
