Drive New Business: Identify and prioritize new business leads and categories with management. Your proactive approach will bring in fresh opportunities and keep our sales pipeline thriving.
Collaborate Across Teams: Coordinate sales activities with internal departments, maximizing resources to meet customer needs and exceed expectations.
Achieve Sales Targets: Consistently meet and exceed monthly and quarterly sales goals, demonstrating your commitment to excellence and growth.
Stay Tech-Savvy: Keep up-to-date with research marketing tools, computer applications, and contact management systems. Leverage your digital knowledge to enhance your sales strategies.
